The classification service follows the native checkpoint inference workflow
in scripts/04_eval_clean.py. It uses the supplied checkpoint unchanged through
Ultralytics 8.4.72. No training, loss replacement or attention injection is done.
Ultralytics remains an external AGPL-3.0 dependency with its original copyright.

The exact checkpoint SHA-256 is
4305e49158129c4a6acaa8fdaf7b5982a7f4d93cc233f11d17479e04b0e438c1.
CVIO's docs/CHECKPOINTS.md and release audit identify it as HISTORICAL_NONFINAL,
with a baseline_ce run name and no SimAMDCFR module. The supplied handoff label
ASL-LDAM / SimAM-DCFR is not treated as verified architecture or performance.

API shape and upload/authentication checks are adapted from SmartShrimp AI
